    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      489.4,
      546.63,
      531.55
    ],
    "text": "The deep depression over the Bay of Bengal is weakening into a depression. The impact of this system on Sri Lanka's weather is expected to gradually decrease from today.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      535.48,
      555.05,
      576.43
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in the Western, Sabaragamuwa, Southern, Central and North-western provinces. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in the above areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      584.74,
      554.81,
      635.47
    ],
    "text": "Fairly strong winds of about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, North-central and North-western provinces and in Trincomalee, Hambantota and Matale Districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      638.62,
      554.83,
      834.03
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
